  "id": "shallow-processing",
  "term": "shallow processing",
  "definition": "Shallow processing refers to handling a task at a surface level, so it can be completed without needing to access the meaning of the material. In the packet, it describes verbal tasks where semantic access is not necessary for successful performance.",
